       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Dose:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** A single dose of 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum of 800 mg. Doses at that level raise the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum).\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth three times daily**, a common regimen for pain or inflammation.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want the original dose, please confirm that it's intentional and give me a clinical rationale for the order note."
